## Node identity and runtime flags for hecate_biotope.
-name ${HECATE_NODE_NAME}@${HECATE_NODE_HOST}
-setcookie ${HECATE_COOKIE}

+K true

## A world tick is CPU-bound arithmetic across many creatures, so the schedulers
## are the resource that matters and the async thread pool is not on that path.
## Left at a modest 8 until there is a world to measure; a number chosen before
## the first measurement is a guess either way, and this one is cheap to revisit.
+A 8
